+/*
+ * THE CHECK ('NORD2 PERF PHOTOS CHECK'): a 16x16 block of what the GPU converted (read back: this waits for the conversion's job)
+ * against rw_tg_ref_bgra over the surface's own bytes (read-only lock). Classified:
+ *   raced     the texture was converted again meanwhile (another generation): nothing to compare;
+ *   stale     the surface's seed/probe moved since this conversion: its next use converts again (follow-live), not an error;
+ *   mismatch  same surface bytes, different picture: a conversion error (gross = a pixel off by more than 48: black, stripes, garbage).
+ */
+- (void)redwoodTGRunCheck:(unsigned long)k gen:(uint64_t)gen seed:(uint32_t)seed probe:(uint32_t)probe
